color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;font-size:12,0000pt;" >Auditor&#237;a de Desarrollo:</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12,0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0,0000pt;" >&nbsp;Al revisar nuestro c&#243;digo PHP y SQL, notamos que aunque usamos </span><span class="15"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
